@baseUrl = http://localhost:5256

### Valid event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tick": 1042, "pointId": 3, "carId": 17, "direction": "NORTH" }

### Invalid direction (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tick": 1043, "pointId": 3, "carId": 18, "direction": "UP" }

### List latest events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events